    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Order line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Приятного аппетита.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enjoy your meal.' Serving a table in the dining room, Sasha wishes the guest a pleasant meal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Саша, привет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sasha, hi.' the guest delivers a punchy conversational reaction built around the Russian word meaning 'hi'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Я хочу есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to eat.' Another guest tells Sasha that he is hungry and ready to order.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Ты попросишь Калифорнию?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you ask for a California roll?' the guest turns a statement into a question purely through rising intonation on the word meaning 'to ask' to make the point directly in conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Да, конечно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, of course.' When the guest asks for a 'California' roll, Sasha gladly agrees to bring it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Хорошо, спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, thanks.' She thanks the guest and turns to place the sushi order.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Ой, что это?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, what is this?' Suddenly noticing a commotion at a nearby table, Sasha gasps in alarm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Человеку плохо!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A person is feeling bad!' A diner shouts that someone in the hall has fallen terribly ill.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Что случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?' Sasha rushes over and asks what happened to the guest.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Ему очень плохо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He feels really bad.' The bystander explains that the man is in bad shape after eating.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Помогите!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Help!' Panicking, Sasha calls out to the staff for help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Скорую вызовите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
